step	1	-	Speaking to Queen Zyanyi Arkan
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Servius, Teokan of Ralos</col> in the <col=800000>Sunrise Palace</col> in <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>. He told me that <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi Arkan</col> wishes to speak with me. I should let him know when I'm ready to meet with her.</col>
step	2	-	Infiltrating the temple
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Servius, Teokan of Ralos</col> in the <col=800000>Sunrise Palace</col> in <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>. He took me to meet with <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi Arkan</col>, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, <col=800000>Prince Itzla Arkan</col>, from the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col>. She told me to go to the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> to gather information on the <col=800000>Emissaries'</col> plans for <col=800000>Itzla</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Entering the dungeon
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> and witnessed <col=800000>Metzli</col> giving a speech to her followers with <col=800000>Ennius</col> and <col=800000>Furia</col> at her side. During the speech, <col=800000>Itzla</col> was brought out from a <col=800000>Dungeon</col> directly below the <col=800000>Temple</col>. I should explore this <col=800000>Dungeon</col> and see what I can discover.</col>
step	4	-	Searching for Itzla
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<col=000080>I entered the <col=800000>Dungeon</col> below the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> and snuck into <col=800000>Metzli's Chamber</col>. There, I overheard her revealing to <col=800000>Furia</col> that she'd moved <col=800000>Itzla</col> elsewhere. I should explore her <col=800000>Chamber</col> and see what else I can discover.</col>
step	5	-	Returning to Queen Zyanyi
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<col=000080>I explored <col=800000>Metzli's Chamber</col> and found a <col=800000>Message</col> that might be of use. A <col=800000>Guard</col> found me and took the <col=800000>Message</col> from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The <col=800000>Message</col> revealed the locatino of a <col=800000>Cultist Safe House</col> is <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>. I should return to <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col> and let her know about this.</col>
step	6	-	Meeting Captain Vibia
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col> in <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col> and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with <col=800000>Captain Vibia</col> at the <col=800000>Cultist Safe House</col>. The two of us must then gain entry into the <col=800000>House</col> and capture <col=800000>Forebearer Janus</col>, the cultist living there. I can find the <col=800000>House</col> opposite the western <col=800000>Bank</col> in <col=800000>Civitas illa Fortis</col>.</col>
