line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<col=000080>Now that we have full access to the <col=800000>House</col>, we need to prepare for <col=800000>Forebearer Janus</col> to return. To do so, I need to find something to restrain him with and something to knock him out with. I should look around the <col=800000>House</col> and see what I can use.</col>
step	11	-	The Queen's interrogation
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<str> I returned to Queen Zyanyi in Civitas illa Fortis and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House. The two of us must then gain entry into the House and capture Forebearer Janus, the cultist living there.</str>
line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<str>After gaining access to the House, we started preparing for Forebearer Janus to return. To do so, I created a Makeshift Blackjack and gave Captain Vibia a Sack. Once he arrived, Captain Vibia used the Sack to restrain him and I knocked him out with the Blackjack. Captain Vibia then departed to fetch Queen Zyanyi.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col> arrived at the <col=800000>House</col> and asked to be left alone with <col=800000>Forebearer Janus</col> so that she could interrogate him. By the time we returned later, <col=800000>Janus</col> was dead. I should see what the <col=800000>Queen</col> learnt from him.</col>
step	12	-	Heading to Cam Torum
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<str> I returned to Queen Zyanyi in Civitas illa Fortis and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House. The two of us must then gain entry into the House and capture Forebearer Janus, the cultist living there.</str>
line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<str>After gaining access to the House, we started preparing for Forebearer Janus to return. To do so, I created a Makeshift Blackjack and gave Captain Vibia a Sack. Once he arrived, Captain Vibia used the Sack to restrain him and I knocked him out with the Blackjack. Captain Vibia then departed to fetch Queen Zyanyi.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col> arrived at the <col=800000>House</col> and asked to be left alone with <col=800000>Forebearer Janus</col> so that she could interrogate him. By the time we returned later, <col=800000>Janus</col> was dead. However, before he died, he told the <col=800000>Queen</col> of the <col=800000>Emissaries'</col> plan to use <col=800000>Itzla</col> to gain entry into the <col=800000>Crypt of Tonali</col> in the <col=800000>Tlati Rainforest</col>. According to him, they believe the <col=800000>Crypt</col> to contain a path to <col=800000>Mokhaiotl</col>. To achieve entry into the <col=800000>Crypt</col>, the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> are apparently seeking help from some <col=800000>Dwarves</col> in <col=800000>Cam Torum</col>. The <col=800000>Queen</col> has decided that we must investigate this. I should speak to her when I'm ready to depart for <col=800000>Cam Torum</col>. Alternatively, I can make my own way there.</col>
step	13	-	Meeting Attala
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<str> I returned to Queen Zyanyi in Civitas illa Fortis and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House. The two of us must then gain entry into the House and capture Forebearer Janus, the cultist living there.</str>
line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<str>After gaining access to the House, we started preparing for Forebearer Janus to return. To do so, I created a Makeshift Blackjack and gave Captain Vibia a Sack. Once he arrived, Captain Vibia used the Sack to restrain him and I knocked him out with the Blackjack. Captain Vibia then departed to fetch Queen Zyanyi.</str>
line	<str>Queen Zyanyi arrived at the House and asked to be left alone with Forebearer Janus so that she could interrogate him. By the time we returned later, Janus was dead. However, before he died, he told Queen Zyanyi of the Emissaries' plan to use Itzla to gain entry into the Crypt of Tonali in the Tlati Rainforest. He claimed this was due to the Crypt containing a path to Mokhaiotl. Janus also revealed that the Emissaries were seeking help from some Dwarves in Cam Torum to achieve entry into the crypt.</str>
line	<col=000080>I journeyed to <col=800000>Cam Torum</col> with <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col> and <col=800000>Servius</col>. There, we met with <col=800000>Highlord Katlo</col>. He claimed he wasn't aware of any <col=800000>Emissaries</col> in <col=800000>Cam Torum</col>, but his advisor, <col=800000>Attala</col>, convinced him to let us investigate anyway. The <col=800000>Queen</col> departed for the <col=800000>Tlati Rainforest</col>, leaving <col=800000>Servius</col> and I to find the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> with <col=800000>Attala's</col> help. I should speak to her in the <col=800000>Cam Torum Market</col> when I'm ready to begin.</col>
step	14	-	Investigating Teumo
