line	<str>I journeyed to Cam Torum with Queen Zyanyi and Servius. There, we met with Highlord Katlo. He claimed he wasn't aware of any Emissaries in Cam Torum, but his advisor, Attala, convinced him to let us investigate anyway. Queen Zyanyi departed for the Tlati Rainforest, leaving Servius and I to find the Emissaries with Attala's help.</str>
line	<str>Servius and I met with Attala in the Cam Torum Market. She suggested we start by investigating Teumo, one of the few dwarves able to allow humans into the city.</str>
line	<col=800000>I met with <col=800000>Servius</col> and <col=800000>Attala</col> in <col=800000>Teumo's</col> home in eastern <col=800000>Cam Torum</col>. I searched the house and found a <col=800000>Secret Tunnel</col>. I explored the <col=800000>Tunnel</col> and was able to spy on a meeting between <col=800000>Teumo</col>, <col=800000>Ennius</col> and <col=800000>Furia</col>. During the meeting, <col=800000>Teumo</col> agreed to help them gain access to the <col=800000>Crypt of Tonali</col>, but first asked them to retrieve and <col=800000>Old One Keystone</col> from within <col=800000>Neypotzli</col> for him. I should let <col=800000>Servius</col> and <col=800000>Attala</col> know about this.</col>
step	16	-	Hunting down the keystone
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<str> I returned to Queen Zyanyi in Civitas illa Fortis and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House. The two of us must then gain entry into the House and capture Forebearer Janus, the cultist living there.</str>
line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<str>After gaining access to the House, we started preparing for Forebearer Janus to return. To do so, I created a Makeshift Blackjack and gave Captain Vibia a Sack. Once he arrived, Captain Vibia used the Sack to restrain him and I knocked him out with the Blackjack. Captain Vibia then departed to fetch Queen Zyanyi.</str>
line	<str>Queen Zyanyi arrived at the House and asked to be left alone with Forebearer Janus so that she could interrogate him. By the time we returned later, Janus was dead. However, before he died, he told Queen Zyanyi of the Emissaries' plan to use Itzla to gain entry into the Crypt of Tonali in the Tlati Rainforest. He claimed this was due to the Crypt containing a path to Mokhaiotl. Janus also revealed that the Emissaries were seeking help from some Dwarves in Cam Torum to achieve entry into the crypt.</str>
line	<str>I journeyed to Cam Torum with Queen Zyanyi and Servius. There, we met with Highlord Katlo. He claimed he wasn't aware of any Emissaries in Cam Torum, but his advisor, Attala, convinced him to let us investigate anyway. Queen Zyanyi departed for the Tlati Rainforest, leaving Servius and I to find the Emissaries with Attala's help.</str>
line	<str>Servius and I met with Attala in the Cam Torum Market. I searched the house and found a Secret Tunnel. I explored the Tunnel and was able to spy on a meeting between Teumo, Ennius and Furia. During the meeting, Teumo agreed to help them gain access to the Crypt of the Tonali, but first asked them to retrieve an Old One Keystone from within Neypotzli for him.</str>
line	<str>I told Servius and Attala what I'd discovered. Servius left to inform Queen Zyanyi while Attala set out to find and deal with Teumo.</str>
line	<col=800000>I entered <col=800000>Neypotzli</col> and encountered <col=800000>Eyatlalli</col>. She gave me a <col=800000>Keystone Fragment</col> which I can use to find the <col=800000>Old One Keystone</col> that <col=800000>Ennius</col> and <col=800000>Furia</col> are looking for. If I can find the <col=800000>Keystone</col>, I should be able to find them as well.</col>
step	17	-	Reporting to the queen
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple and witnessed Metzli giving a speech to her followers with Ennius and Furia at her side. During the speech, Itzla was brought out from a Dungeon directly below the Temple.</str>
line	<str>I entered the Dungeon below the Twilight Temple and snuck into Metzli's Chamber. There, I overheard her revealing to Furia that she'd moved Itzla elsewhere.</str>
line	<str>I explored Metzli's Chamber and found a Message that might be of use. A Guard found me and took the Message from me, but I was able to defeat him and get it back. The Message revealed the location of a Cultist Safe House in Civitas illa Fortis.</str>
line	<str> I returned to Queen Zyanyi in Civitas illa Fortis and told her what I'd discovered. She directed me to meet with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House. The two of us must then gain entry into the House and capture Forebearer Janus, the cultist living there.</str>
line	<str>I met with Captain Vibia at the Cultist Safe House in south western Civitas illa Fortis. While she kept watch, I found a Window for us to use to get into the House, distracted a Dog on the other side, and then unlocked a Door leading to the rest of the House</str>
line	<str>After gaining access to the House, we started preparing for Forebearer Janus to return. To do so, I created a Makeshift Blackjack and gave Captain Vibia a Sack. Once he arrived, Captain Vibia used the Sack to restrain him and I knocked him out with the Blackjack. Captain Vibia then departed to fetch Queen Zyanyi.</str>
line	<str>Queen Zyanyi arrived at the House and asked to be left alone with Forebearer Janus so that she could interrogate him. By the time we returned later, Janus was dead. However, before he died, he told Queen Zyanyi of the Emissaries' plan to use Itzla to gain entry into the Crypt of Tonali in the Tlati Rainforest. He claimed this was due to the Crypt containing a path to Mokhaiotl. Janus also revealed that the Emissaries were seeking help from some Dwarves in Cam Torum to achieve entry into the crypt.</str>
line	<str>I journeyed to Cam Torum with Queen Zyanyi and Servius. There, we met with Highlord Katlo. He claimed he wasn't aware of any Emissaries in Cam Torum, but his advisor, Attala, convinced him to let us investigate anyway. Queen Zyanyi departed for the Tlati Rainforest, leaving Servius and I to find the Emissaries with Attala's help.</str>
line	<str>Servius and I met with Attala in the Cam Torum Market. I searched the house and found a Secret Tunnel. I explored the Tunnel and was able to spy on a meeting between Teumo, Ennius and Furia. During the meeting, Teumo agreed to help them gain access to the Crypt of the Tonali, but first asked them to retrieve an Old One Keystone from within Neypotzli for him.</str>
line	<str>I told Servius and Attala what I'd discovered. Servius left to inform Queen Zyanyi while Attala set out to find and deal with Teumo.</str>
line	<str>I entered Neypotzli and encountered Eyatlalli. She gave me a Keystone Fragment which I used to find the Old One Keystone that Ennius and Furia were looking for. However, I wasn't able to stop them before they could take it. Although they got away, they left behind a pair of Emissaries. However, I was able to defeat them.</str>
line	<col=800000>I spoke with <col=800000>Attala</col> about what happened with the <col=800000>Old One Keystone</col> and she told me that <col=800000>Teumo</col> was able to escape from <col=800000>Cam Torum</col>. As a result, the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col> now have all that they need to access the <col=800000>Crypt of Tonali</col>. I should head to <col=800000>Tal Teklan</col> in the <col=800000>Tlati Rainforest</col> and report this to <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi</col>.</col>
step	18	-	Searching the caverns
line	<str>I spoke to Servius, Teokan of Ralos in the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis. He took me to meet with Queen Zyanyi Arkan, who tasked me with helping to rescue her son, Prince Itzla Arkan, from the Twilight Emissaries. She told me to go to the Twilight Temple to gather information on the Emissaries' plans for Itzla.</str>
