line	<str>Queen Zyanyi offered Ennius and Furia the chance to surrender, but Ennius refused. As a result, we had no choice but to fight and kill him. However, Furia was able to escape and follow Metzli down into the Caverns beneath the Crypt. Despite having only just been rescued, Itzla volunteered to join me in following the two down into the Caverns.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I travelled down into the Caverns beneath the Crypt of Tonali. We explored them, but couldn't find Furia or Metzli. However, we instead found some Old One Ruins.</str>
line	<col=800000><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I entered the <col=800000>Old One Ruins</col> and found <col=800000>Metzli</col>. She revealed the <col=800000>Ruins</col> to be <col=800000>Mokhaiotl</col>, an <col=800000>Archive</col> build by the <col=800000>Old Ones</col> before they went extinct. She also revealed that she never believed in the <col=800000>Final Dawn</col>. Instead, she was simply using <col=800000>Ennius</col>, <col=800000>Furia</col> and the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col> to find and access <col=800000>Mokhaiotl</col> in hopes of claiming the knowledge of the <col=800000>Old Ones</col> for herself. <col=800000>Metzli</col> then attacked us, but we were able to fight her off. Despite being injured, she was able to flee deeper into the <col=800000>Ruins</col>. We'll need to follow her.</col>
